ency: Euro Data last updated: 09/2024"	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	n/a	-0.055	-0.214	-0.304	-0.278	-0.327	-0.218	-0.203	-0.471	-0.86	-0.618	-0.506	-0.654	-0.601	-0.77	-1.357	-1.41	-1.32	-1.096	-0.544	0.384	0.863	0.359	0.416	0.682	0.312	-1.056	-0.591	0.592	0.773	0.906	0.99	1.056	0.772	0.692	0.609	2023
